{"product_id":"attack-on-titan-no-regrets-2","title":"Attack on Titan: No Regrets 2","description":"\u003cp\u003eREMEMBER YOUR TRUE ENEMYErwin’s political enemies have hired Levi and his crew to take back some incriminating documents. Their reward: the right to live a proud life above ground, in the royal capital. But deep in Titan territory, it’s going to be tough to break formation and steal from a squad leader, and Levi still insists on killing the man who humiliated him after the mission is complete. Of course, beyond the walls anything can happen, and a sudden change in Levi’s fortunes will force him to face the greatest regret in his life…FINAL VOLUME!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Hajime Isayama\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781612629438\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45841444896921,"sku":"Manga-A-39781612629438","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690244fbf317a_71ZnHVTKJSL.jpg?v=1761759392","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/attack-on-titan-no-regrets-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}